title: Rabbit
---
=> E-e-xcuse me, do you know where the exit is?
=> Have you seen the friend I came with?
=> I am crashing out! I have hopped all over this giant warehouse but I still can't find my limited edition signed copy of Magical Girl manga. You've read the series right? Kinda awkward if you haven't...
=> I'm afraid... of intimacy.
=> Have you seen my dad?
